1 REM FBCS GFX-0189
2 REM CLAIM A-13.5.2-TR134
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 13.5.2 l.10514-10518, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: the DRAW of the detached-handler of an EXTERNAL SUB is
5 REM checked against the DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE of the unit.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
20 CALL E
30 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB E
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE P
120 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
130   CAUSE EXCEPTION 5
140 END WHEN
150 HANDLER H
160   DRAW P
170 END HANDLER
180 END SUB
200 EXTERNAL PICTURE P
210 PRINT "P"; EXTYPE
220 END PICTURE
